"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/AltTextAccessibility_description=Enter text describing the appearance of the image from a visual perspective, focusing on details that are relevant to the purpose and meaning of the image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/AltTextAccessibility_label=Alt Text"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrCity_description=Enter the City for the address of the person that created this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrCity_label=City"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrCtry_description=Enter the Country name for the address of the person that created this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrCtry_label=Country"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrExtadr_description=Enter Address for the person that created this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrExtadr_label=Address"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrPcode_description=Enter the Postal Code for the address of the person that created this imag"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrPcode_label=Postal Code"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrRegion_description=Enter the State for the address of the person that created this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiAdrRegion_label=State/Province"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiEmailWork_description=Enter the work Email address(es) for the person that created this image, such as name@domain.com"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiEmailWork_label=E-Mail(s)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiTelWork_description=Enter the work Phone number(s) for the person that created this image, using the international format, such as +1 (123) 456789"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiTelWork_label=Phone(s)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiUrlWork_description=Enter the work Web URL(s) for the person that created this image, such as http://www.domain.com/"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CiUrlWork_label=Website(s)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/City_description=Enter the name of the City"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CountryCode_description=Enter the 2 or 3 letter ISO 3166 Country Code of the Country pictured in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CountryCode_label=ISO Country Code"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CreatorContactInfo_description=The photographer's contact information"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/CreatorContactInfo_label=IPTC Contact"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/ExtDescrAccessibility_description=Enter the text describing the appearance of an image from a visual perspective, focusing on relevant details that further describe the meaning and purpose of the image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/ExtDescrAccessibility_label=Extended Description"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/IntellectualGenre_description=Enter a term to describe the nature of this image in terms of its intellectual or journalistic characteristics (examples at: http://www.newscodes.org/)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/IntellectualGenre_label=Intellectual Genre"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/Location_description=Enter the name of the Sublocation pictured in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/Location_label=Sublocation"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/Scene_description=Enter only values from the IPTC Scene NewsCodes Controlled Vocabulary (see: http://www.newscodes.org/)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/Scene_label=IPTC Scene Code"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/SubjectCode_description=Enter only values from the IPTC Subject NewsCode Controlled Vocabulary (see: http://www.newscodes.org/)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/SubjectCode_label=IPTC Subject Code"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/custom/AltTextAccessibility_hint=(Accessibility) A brief text description to convey equivalent information for an image to assistive technology users."
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/custom/CountryCode_hint=The location above could either be the location shown in the image or the location from which the photo was taken. To make a clear distinction use the two Location properties on the IPTC Ext panel"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/custom/ExtDescrAccessibility_hint=(Accessibility) A detailed description of image content, expanding on the Alt Text property."
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/custom/Scene_hint=Scene values are defined at http://www.newscodes.org, multiple values may be separated by a comma or semicolon"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore/custom/SubjectCode_hint=Subject Codes are defined at http://www.newscodes.org, semicolons or commas can be used to separate multiple values"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore_description=IPTC Photo Metadata provides data about photographs and the values can be processed by software. Each individual metadata entity is called a property and they are grouped into Administrative, Descriptive and Rights Related properties."
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpCore_label=IPTC Core Properties"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOCopyrightNotice_description=Enter any necessary copyright notice for claiming the intellectual property for artwork or an object in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOCopyrightNotice_label=Copyright notice"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOCreator_description=Enter the name of the artist who has created artwork or an object in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOCreator_label=Creator"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AODateCreated_description=Enter the date and optionally the time when the artwork or object in this image was created"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AODateCreated_label=Date created"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOSourceInvNo=Source inventory number"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOSourceInvNo_description=Enter the inventory number issued by the organisation or body holding and registering the artwork or object in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOSource_description=Enter the name of the organisation or body holding and registering the artwork or object in this image for inventory purposes"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOSource_label=Source"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOTitle_description=Enter the verbal and human readable name of the artwork or object in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AOTitle_label=Title"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AddlModelInfo_description=Enter information like ethnicity or other details about the model(s) in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/AddlModelInfo_label=Additional Model Info"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ArtworkOrObjectDetails_description=A structured datatype for details about artwork or an object in an image. Includes a Copyright Notice, a Creator, a Date Created, a Source, a Source Inventory Number and a Title."
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ArtworkOrObjectDetails_label=Artwork or Object in the Image Details"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ArtworkOrObject_description=Enter details about artwork or objects shown in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ArtworkOrObject_label=Artwork or Object"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CVterm_description=Enter an identifier for the controlled vocabulary, then a colon, and finally the code from the vocabulary assigned to the term"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CVterm_label=Controlled Vocabulary Term"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/City_label=City"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CountryCode_description=Enter the 2 or 3 letter ISO 3166 Country Code of the Country"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CountryCode_label=Country ISO-Code"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CountryName_description=Enter the name of the Country"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/CountryName_label=Country Name"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigImageGUID_description=Globally unique identifier for the item. It is created and applied by the creator of the item at the time of its creation. This value shall not be changed after that time"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigImageGUID_label=Digital Image Identifier"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType/1=Original digital capture of a real life scene"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType/2=Digitised from a negative on film"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType/3=Digitised from a positive on film"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType/4=Digitised from a print on non-transparent medium"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType/5=Created by software"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType_description=Select one of the values for identifying the type of the source of the digital image from the controlled vocabulary"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/DigitalSourceType_label=Digital Source Type"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/EventId_description=Enter one or more identifiers of the event where this image was taken"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/EventId_label=Event ID"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/Event_description=Enter the name or description of the event where this image was taken"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/Event_label=Event"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationCreated_description=Enter the details about a location where this image was created"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationCreated_label=Location Created"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationDetails_description=A structured datatype for details of a location. It includes a Sublocation, a City, a Province or State, a Country (Name and ISO-Code) and a World Region."
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationDetails_label=Location Details"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationShown_description=Enter the details about a location which is shown in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/LocationShown_label=Location Shown"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/MaxAvailHeight_description=Enter the maximum available height in pixels of the original photo from which this photo has been derived by downsizing"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/MaxAvailHeight_label=Max. Available Height"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/MaxAvailWidth_description=Enter the maximum available width in pixels of the original photo from which this photo has been derived by downsizing"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/MaxAvailWidth_label=Max. Available Width"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ModelAge_description=Enter the age of the human model(s) at the time this image was made"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ModelAge_label=Model Age"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/OrganisationInImageCode_description=Enter an identifier for the controlled vocabulary, then a colon, and finally the code from the vocabulary assigned to the organisation shown in this image (e.g. nasdaq:companyA)"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/OrganisationInImageCode_label=Code of Featured Organisation"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/OrganisationInImageName_description=Enter the name of the organisation which is featured by this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/OrganisationInImageName_label=Name of Featured Organisation"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/PersonInImage_description=Enter the name of the person shown in this image"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/PersonInImage_label=Person Shown"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ProvinceState_description=Enter the name of the Province or State"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/ProvinceState_label=Province/State"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/RegItemId_description=Enter the unique identifier created by a registry and applied by the creator of the digital image. This value shall not be changed after being applied"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/RegItemId_label=Item Identifier"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/RegOrgId_description=Enter the identifier for the registry which issued the corresponding Registry Image ID"
"$$$/xmp/Iptc4xmpExt/RegOrgId_label=Organisation Identifier"
