"$$$/xmp/alt_description=An alternative array is a set of one or more values, one of which should be chosen. In the schema definitions, an alternative array is referred to as an alt. For example, xmp:Thumbnails is defined as alt Thumbnail. There are no specific rules for selection of alternatives: in some situations, an application may make a choice; in others, a user may make a choice. The first item in the array is considered by RDF to be the default value."
"$$$/xmp/alt_label=Alt"
