"$$$/xmp/exifEX/InteroperabilityIndex_description=Indicates the identification of the Interoperability rule.#{endl}\"R98\" = Indicates a file conforming to R98 file specification of Recommended Exif Interoperability Rules (Exif R 98) or to DCF basic file stipulated by Design Rule for Camera File System (DCF).#{endl}\"THM\" = Indicates a file conforming to DCF thumbnail file stipulated by Design rule for Camera File System.#{endl}\"R03\" = Indicates a file conforming to DCF Option File stipulated by Design rule for Camera File System."
